    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are a professional YouTube script writer.\n\nWrite a short narration script for a YouTube video about:\n\n10 Amazing Facts About Space\n\nRequirements:\n- Language: English\n- Length: approximately 45 to 50 words\n- Suitable for about 20 seconds of narration\n- Start with an interesting hook\n- Include several amazing space facts\n- Use simple, natural spoken English\n- End with a short call to action\n- No emojis\n- No markdown\n- No bullet points\n- No numbering\n- No scene directions\n- No JSON\n- No array\n- No quotation marks\n\nIMPORTANT:\nReturn ONLY the narration text.\nDo not return anything before or after the narration.\n\nExample style:\nDid you know space is stranger than you think? Venus has a day longer than its year, neutron stars are incredibly dense, and billions of stars fill our galaxy. These cosmic facts show just how amazing our universe really is. Follow for more fascinating facts about space.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
